{"words": [{"text": "وَمِنَ", "translation": "And among"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "the mankind"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "يَتَّخِذُ", "translation": "takes"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دُونِ", "translation": "besides"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "أَندَادًۭا", "translation": "equals"}, {"text": "يُحِبُّونَهُمْ", "translation": "They love them"}, {"text": "كَحُبِّ", "translation": "as (they should) love"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "أَشَدُّ", "translation": "(are) stronger"}, {"text": "حُبًّۭا", "translation": "(in) love"}, {"text": "لِّلَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "for Allah"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "يَرَى", "translation": "would see"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ظَلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "wronged"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "يَرَوْنَ", "translation": "they will see"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابَ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُوَّةَ", "translation": "the power"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "translation": "(belongs) to Allah"}, {"text": "جَمِيعًۭا", "translation": "all"}, {"text": "وَأَنَّ", "translation": "and [that]"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "شَدِيدُ", "translation": "(is) severe"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "translation": "(in) [the] punishment"}], "sahih": "And [yet], among the people are those who take other than Allāh as equals [to Him]. They love them as they [should] love Allāh. But those who believe are stronger in love for Allāh. And if only they who have wronged would consider [that] when they see the punishment, [they will be certain] that all power belongs to Allāh and that Allāh is severe in punishment."}